### Demonstration Requests for Pages API and Routes

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. List all published static pages
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/pages
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Privacy Policy page by primary slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/pages/privacy-policy
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Privacy Policy page by alias (privacy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/pages/privacy
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Terms of Service page by primary slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/pages/terms-of-service
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Terms of Service page by alias (terms)
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/pages/terms
Accept: application/json

### 6. View Privacy Policy via frontend route /p/privacy-policy
GET {{baseUrl}}/p/privacy-policy
Accept: text/html

### 7. View Terms of Service via frontend route /page/terms-of-service
GET {{baseUrl}}/page/terms-of-service
Accept: text/html
